        "description": "__Height:__ 175 cm (5'8\")\n\nKimimaro's mother died and his father is missing, so he was raised by relatives. He currently lives alone and goes to university. He dreams of a normal life with a normal family.\n\n~!The truth behind the disappearance of his father is that he went bankrupt. His asset, Mua, looked a lot like Msyu too.!~",
